  "db_name": "SQLite",
  "query": "-- The user's saved matches the still-open check looks at (matches::still_open): not rejected,\n-- not found closed, and not said to be open by the user. ?1 what closed_why says\n-- when the user said a job is still open.\nSELECT\n  m.id,\n  m.job_url,\n  m.job_text,\n  m.created_at,\n  m.deadline,\n  m.still_open_checked_at\nFROM matches m\nWHERE m.rejected_at IS NULL\n  AND m.closed_at IS NULL\n  AND m.closed_why != ?1\nORDER BY m.created_at DESC, m.id DESC\n",
